request.description:
GET /api/admin/dashboard — Returns full Doctor[] and Patient[] lists.

Source: AdminApiController.dashboard()
Response shape: { doctors: [...], patients: [...] }

GET /api/admin/statistics — Returns aggregate counts and appointment breakdowns.

Source: AdminApiController.getStatistics()
Response: { totalDoctors, totalPatients, totalAppointments, pending, confirmed, cancelled }

item.description:
Admin CRUD operations on Doctor records.

Base: /api/admin/doctor  |  Requires: {{admin_token}}
Note: Admin can update doctor info and password, and delete doctors.

request.description:
GET /admin/api/patients/{id} — Retrieves a single patient by ID.

Source: AdminDashboardController.getPatientById(@PathVariable long id)
Response: { success, message, data: Patient }

item.description:
Doctor-side appointment management and patient record access.

Base: /api/doctor  |  Requires: {{doctor_token}}
Appointment statuses: PENDING | CONFIRMED | CANCELLED | COMPLETED

request.description:
GET /api/doctor/dashboard — Returns all patients as PatientSummaryDTO[].

Source: ConsultationApiController.getDashboard()
Response: PatientSummaryDTO[] { id, email, fullName, phone, address, dateOfBirth, firstName, lastName, avatar }

GET /api/patient/clinical-info/{id} — Retrieves the patient's clinical information record.

Source: PatientAuthApiController.getClinicalInfo(@PathVariable Long id)
Response: PatientClinicalInforDTO { id, patientId, bloodType, allergies, chronicDiseases, familyMedicalHistory, lastUpdatedById, lastUpDatedTime }

item.description:
Patient-side appointment booking and listing.

Base: /api/patient/appointment  |  Requires: {{patient_token}}
Appointment flow: Book → Doctor confirms/cancels

request.description:
GET /api/patient/appointment/doctors — Returns the full Doctor entity list for the booking UI.

Source: PatientAppointmentApiController.getDoctors()
Response: Doctor[] { id, email, firstName, lastName, field, phone, address, ROLE, avatar }
